      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"Show Avatar\" already saves persistently to your LocalPlayerModerations set, at least on Windows. On mobile platforms, it seems very much intended to reset that to Safety Shield whenever a Very Poor avatar would be loaded to avoid performance issues, because Very Poor performance ranked avatars are not really intended to be displayed on mobile.\n\n\"Show Avatar\" for Very Poor avatars functionality may be removed in the future, and Very Poor avatars may be removed from Android and iOS entirely. (https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-performance-ranking-system/#overriding-individual-avatars)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
